# Agent continuity at session start (mandatory)

Do **not** wait for the user to ask. On the **first agent turn of every new chat/session** in this workspace:

1. **Run** (DGX):
   ```bash
   bash scripts/verify-agent-continuity.sh --all-repos
   ```
   Surface:
   ```powershell
   .\scripts\verify-agent-continuity.ps1
   ```
2. If FAIL → fix missing rules/hooks/files in the same turn, then re-run until PASS (or report a true blocker).
3. **Load memory** (read, don't skip):
   - RepoResident: `.agent/STATE.md`, `CLAUDE.md`
   - MindLink: `.brain/MEMORY.md`, `.brain/SESSION.md` (+ `.agent/areas/mindlink.md`)
   - Cursor memory bank: `memory-bank/activeContext.md` when present
4. **Hooks** also fire `sessionStart` / `workspaceOpen` → `.cursor/hooks/session-continuity.sh` (and `~/.cursor/hooks/` on DGX). Treat hook `OPENNEXUS_CONTINUITY_STATUS` as a hint; still run the script if you have not verified this session.
5. After DGX edits under `src/`, auto-push:
   ```bash
   bash scripts/sync-changes-to-pc.sh --include-src --retry-until-complete
   ```

SessionMem team sync (`sync-sessionmem-team.sh`) after milestones when memories changed — do not skip silently if the user said “remember” / continuity / push to Surface.
